<div class="overview"><div><h2>泊位占位阶段流</h2><ol class="timeline">
{% for stop in report.pricing.stays[:4] %}<li><time>{{ local(stop.start) }}</time><div><strong>{{ stop.berth }}</strong> <code>{{ stop.vehicle[:8] }}</code><p>{{ stop.minutes }} 分钟 · {{ label[stop.association] }} · {{ yuan(stop.due_cents) }}</p></div></li>{% else %}<li>窗口内暂无停靠。</li>{% endfor %}</ol></div>
<section class="panel summary"><h3>泊位分钟勾稽</h3><div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>泊位</th><th>应管</th><th>空闲</th><th>待核</th><th>争议</th><th>实计</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for berth in report.settlement.berths %}<tr><td>{{ berth.berth }}</td><td>{{ berth.scheduled }}</td><td>{{ berth.vacant }}</td><td class="{{ 'difference' if berth.pending else '' }}">{{ berth.pending }}</td><td>{{ berth.disputed }}</td><td>{{ berth.free+berth.base+berth.upgrade }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
{% if report.outages.berths %}<p>停测申报 {{ report.outages.outage_minutes }} 分钟，其中 {{ report.outages.covered_minutes }} 分钟有检测核实、{{ report.outages.other_pole_minutes }} 分钟由他杆补足，剩余 <b>{{ report.outages.pending_minutes }}</b> 分钟待核。</p>{% endif %}<p class="difference">逐单净差 {{ yuan(money.difference_cents) }}</p><p>游离回执 {{ yuan(money.orphan_cents) }}</p><a href="{{ path('settlement') }}">对照实收差价 →</a></section></div>
